    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is still being worked on so try the demo first and buy the game if you want to support the development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our first game so we want to let as many people try it as possible, but if you enjoy it feel free to support us by buying the game! The demo gives you access to 3 characters and lets you try the game before you buy. Please give it a try and if you have any issues or feedback contact us! We are still working on the game and fixing bugs, but people wanted a way to support the development so the game is available for purchase.<br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Knock back and knock out opponents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and launch your opponents around the arena. As you deal damage your opponents will get knocked back further and faster. Position yourself and aim your attacks to knock your opponents out of the ring. In the Bash game mode knock opponents into parts of the environment that have been corrupted by magic to knock them out.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/6e38bda5017008cab302bd7bab959164.poster.avif?t=1747836121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/6e38bda5017008cab302bd7bab959164.webm?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/6e38bda5017008cab302bd7bab959164.mp4?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tag team fighting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a team of three characters that can be swapped to mid combo. Strategically create a team, pick characters that cover each others weaknesses, or play to each others strengths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/aa4bd4230cf849548a3393383fd9db5a.poster.avif?t=1747836121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/aa4bd4230cf849548a3393383fd9db5a.webm?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/aa4bd4230cf849548a3393383fd9db5a.mp4?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Brawl and Bash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 3 other players and many enemies to get loot that powers you up in this unique 4 player free-for-all throughout the city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/2126283e6468e229a158a0ac2d9729fd.poster.avif?t=1747836121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/2126283e6468e229a158a0ac2d9729fd.webm?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/2126283e6468e229a158a0ac2d9729fd.mp4?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is still being worked on so try the demo first and buy the game if you want to support the development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our first game so we want to let as many people try it as possible, but if you enjoy it feel free to support us by buying the game! The demo gives you access to 3 characters and lets you try the game before you buy. Please give it a try and if you have any issues or feedback contact us! We are still working on the game and fixing bugs, but people wanted a way to support the development so the game is available for purchase.<br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Knock back and knock out opponents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and launch your opponents around the arena. As you deal damage your opponents will get knocked back further and faster. Position yourself and aim your attacks to knock your opponents out of the ring. In the Bash game mode knock opponents into parts of the environment that have been corrupted by magic to knock them out.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/6e38bda5017008cab302bd7bab959164.poster.avif?t=1747836121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/6e38bda5017008cab302bd7bab959164.webm?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/6e38bda5017008cab302bd7bab959164.mp4?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tag team fighting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a team of three characters that can be swapped to mid combo. Strategically create a team, pick characters that cover each others weaknesses, or play to each others strengths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/aa4bd4230cf849548a3393383fd9db5a.poster.avif?t=1747836121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/aa4bd4230cf849548a3393383fd9db5a.webm?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/aa4bd4230cf849548a3393383fd9db5a.mp4?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Brawl and Bash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 3 other players and many enemies to get loot that powers you up in this unique 4 player free-for-all throughout the city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/2126283e6468e229a158a0ac2d9729fd.poster.avif?t=1747836121\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/2126283e6468e229a158a0ac2d9729fd.webm?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990990/extras/2126283e6468e229a158a0ac2d9729fd.mp4?t=1747836121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Brawlers of Duality Is still being developed. It is a top-down arena fighter where damaging enemies launches them harder, launch enemies out of the arena to defeat them. Battle in 1v1, 2v2, and a FFA mode where you defeat enemies to power up and take on other players.",
